+    # ---- ADDED for the dp-fcp-gate comparison (not in the original release) ----
+    # Long-tailed CALIBRATION set. The imbalance is applied only to the
+    # calibration pool: class c keeps a fraction mu^c of its calibration points,
+    # with mu = if_factor^(-1/(n_classes-1)), matching the exponential-profile
+    # convention used in the long-tail literature and in our own harness.
+    # The TEST set is deliberately left untouched and balanced, because coverage
+    # must be measured on every class equally; imbalancing the test set would
+    # hide rare-class failures rather than expose them.
